      "comment": "Valeriy: Mitya and the Special Assignments Battalion",
      "content": "Mitya is a respected Royal Energy Commission scientist and theatre-goer with a living scarf. The Special Assignments Battalion exists to protect important people like him and keep tabs on them. Valeriy arrives wherever Mitya has gone, at the Korolevskiy Theater or Podvorye Restaurant, and Mitya has even predicted the twenty-five-minute gap before an inspection. Mitya calls him 'Sarge'.",
