    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Korolevskiy Theater",
        "Wraith's Nocturne",
        "Operation Showtime"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Valeriy"
      ],
      "comment": "Valeriy: Korolevskiy Theater storm",
      "content": "The \"Spirit Seeker\" preview performance ended with a snowstorm that sealed the building. Valeriy took charge as the military's representative, split people into search pairs, assessed the dead (no wounds, no struggle) and kept order. After Shram left, Valeriy took the night watch alone and was found dead in his chair the next morning (Wraith's Nocturne). He later recovered in the real world, with the rest of the cast, after the Ley Line curse was broken.",
