      "key": [
        "Mr. Door"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Valeriy",
        "Chugunov"
      ],
      "comment": "Valeriy: Mr. Door",
      "content": "In an afterlife dream sequence in Winter's Mysterious Silence, a man calling himself Mr. Door defends the Traveler and Chugunov from monsters and a rising black mist as they climb a staircase. He gives his role as his name and finds a door that \"belongs to\" him, stays to hold it shut and tells them to keep going. Afterward the Traveler remembers him; Chugunov half-wonders whether he imagined the man.",
