      "comment": "Valeriy: Stepanyan",
      "content": "Stepanyan, a Grenadier officer who served at the Kuuvahki bureau in Nod-Krai, is described as Valeriy's star student and quotes Valeriy's lessons on courtesy. He says Valeriy is one of the people he most respects and was placed back under his command, signalling an imminent return to Snezhnaya.",
