      "comment": "Valeriy: Alyosha",
      "content": "Alyosha, a Rokot member, was caught sneaking into the Armory Palace by Valeriy, who did not arrest him but urged him to turn back. The meeting gave Alyosha a new contact and a working boundary. In the theatre he warns the Traveler that Valeriy appears mostly to find Mitya.",
