    "5": {
      "uid": 5,
      "key": [
        "Black Feathers Scattered at Parting",
        "theatre laboratory",
        "theater laboratory"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Valeriy",
        "Vesna"
      ],
      "comment": "Valeriy: Theatre laboratory support",
      "content": "In 7.1 Mitya plans to turn the Korolevskiy Theater into a laboratory so that an experiment could continue in the afterlife despite Ronova's Curse of Death. While moving equipment to Snezhnograd he says the military support came thanks to Valeriy and Vesna. When Ronova appears earlier than planned and in the wrong place, he tells Vodyanitsa to get Valeriy and Vesna and have the Rokot evacuate the locals. Valeriy is mentioned, not seen speaking.",
